  "sourceTitle": "Oyster Fritters",
  "sourceText": "Oyster Fritters\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 2:09pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Pancake mix\n1 pint Oysters & juice\n2 tablespoons Onion, finely chopped\n1 teaspoon Baking powder\n1 Egg\nSalt & pepper to taste\n1/4 cup Cooking oil\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine pancake mix, oysters, onion, baking powder, egg, salt and pepper. Drop by tablespoonsful into hot oil. Brown on both sides. Drain on paper towels.",
